<title>UK: OZ Holding sets warrants on Roche Holding.</title>
<headline>OZ Holding sets warrants on Roche Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>OZ Holding said on Friday it has issued one million put warrants on Roche Holding AG.</p>
<p>One Roche genussscheine is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    9,250 SFR</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     9 SFR</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.JUN.97</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   18.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWITZERLAND</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    50</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
